grade biology teacher's living room.

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:21.626
It's not as creepy as it sounds but
it is a scary.

00:00:21.626 --> 00:00:24.855
See, my high school didn't allow
us to be taught sex ed on campus.

00:00:24.855 --> 00:00:29.372
So my 28 classmates and I got our
permission slips signed, put on our coats,

00:00:29.372 --> 00:00:32.680
