Ahmed's house.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.010
Where we sat for an hour,

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:38.929
squeezed in couches, listening to a sex ed
teacher roll condoms onto bruised bananas.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.800
One conversation,
one form of contraception.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:49.233
Four of my girlfriends from growing up,
never made it to college,

00:00:49.233 --> 00:00:51.526
