00:00:51.526 --> 00:00:56.077
I’m not trying to draw a direct cause link
here, but I am trying to make a point.

00:00:56.077 --> 00:00:57.420
This is crazy.

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:03.774
In the US, 51% of pregnancies
every year are unplanned.

00:01:03.774 --> 00:01:05.537
That's half.

00:01:05.537 --> 00:01:06.634
By the age of 45,

00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:10.760
more than half of American women will
have had an unplanned pregnancy.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:14.850
Half.
So, from you here on over today,

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:15.820
congratulations.

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:16.711
You're expecting.

00:01:16.711 --> 00:01:18.337
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH].

00:01:18.337 --> 00:01:21.740
&gt;&gt; Now you don't need to have a uterus to
be a part of this conversation either.

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:24.460
You could be friends with
someone with a uterus,

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:28.550
you could be related to someone with
a uterus, or perhaps most importantly,

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:30.475
