00:01:33.892 --> 00:01:36.650
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; So what's happening here?

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:38.580
Why is this happening?

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:42.290
We're either not using contraceptives or
we're not using them effectively.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.580
Let's take a hypothetical scenario.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.890
Let's say every one in this
room is sexually active.

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:48.910
This is a hypothetical.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:55.250
Say, you're chosen form of
contraception is a withdrawal method,

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:56.530
also known as pull and pray.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:01.730
Over one year of typical use,
22% of us would become pregnant.

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:05.800
Say instead, your chosen form
