00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:11.070
over one year of typical use,
18% of us would still get pregnant.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:16.490
Say instead, you use a pill,
pill is great everyone uses the pill.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:21.690
Over one year of typical use 9%
