00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:26.330
Say instead you use an IUD.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.350
An IUD is an intrauterine device.

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:31.500
It's long acting,
reversible contraceptive.

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:36.540
Say instead your chosen form
of contraception is an IUD.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:41.630
Over one year of typical use 0.2
